<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Feb car registrations down 11.9% yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Belgian Feb car registrations down 11.9% yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian new car registrations fell 11.9 percent in February compared to the same month in 1996, according to figures released on Tuesday from the Belgian Federation of Automobile Manufacturers (Febiac).</p>
</text>
